; Square grid - zigzag cutting pattern
; 2D hot-wire cutting, X/Y only
G21 ; units = mm
G90 ; absolute positioning
G1 X0.000 Y0.000 F500 ; move to the starting point
; cut the square zigzag pattern
G1 X20.000 Y0.000 F300
G1 X20.000 Y20.000 F300
G1 X40.000 Y20.000 F300
G1 X40.000 Y0.000 F300
G1 X60.000 Y0.000 F300
G1 X60.000 Y20.000 F300
G1 X80.000 Y20.000 F300
G1 X80.000 Y0.000 F300
G1 X100.000 Y0.000 F300
G1 X100.000 Y20.000 F300
G1 X120.000 Y20.000 F300
G1 X120.000 Y0.000 F300
; end of row 0
G1 X120.000 Y20.000 F500 ; move to next row (already cut)
G1 X120.000 Y40.000 F300
G1 X100.000 Y40.000 F300
G1 X100.000 Y20.000 F300
G1 X80.000 Y20.000 F300
G1 X80.000 Y40.000 F300
G1 X60.000 Y40.000 F300
G1 X60.000 Y20.000 F300
G1 X40.000 Y20.000 F300
G1 X40.000 Y40.000 F300
G1 X20.000 Y40.000 F300
G1 X20.000 Y20.000 F300
G1 X0.000 Y20.000 F300
; end of row 1
G1 X0.000 Y40.000 F300 ; close remaining edge, move to next row
G1 X20.000 Y40.000 F300
G1 X20.000 Y60.000 F300
G1 X40.000 Y60.000 F300
G1 X40.000 Y40.000 F300
G1 X60.000 Y40.000 F300
G1 X60.000 Y60.000 F300
G1 X80.000 Y60.000 F300
G1 X80.000 Y40.000 F300
G1 X100.000 Y40.000 F300
G1 X100.000 Y60.000 F300
G1 X120.000 Y60.000 F300
G1 X120.000 Y40.000 F300
; end of row 2
G1 X120.000 Y60.000 F500 ; move to next row (already cut)
G1 X120.000 Y80.000 F300
G1 X100.000 Y80.000 F300
G1 X100.000 Y60.000 F300
G1 X80.000 Y60.000 F300
G1 X80.000 Y80.000 F300
G1 X60.000 Y80.000 F300
G1 X60.000 Y60.000 F300
